  "description": "ADO-PARAM discovery after changes: a Command on 'SELECT ID FROM T WHERE L = ?' with Parameters.Refresh and the inventory (Count; Name, Type, Direction, Size, Precision, NumericScale, Value); then CommandText with a second marker (inventory without Refresh, Execute, Refresh, inventory); CommandType = adCmdStoredProc with CommandText \"QByL\" (inventory, Refresh, inventory); Prepared = True (inventory, then Execute with Parameters(0) = 20); CommandText = 'SELECT ID FROM T' (inventory, Execute); CommandText = \"QSet\" (Refresh, inventory); each step also reads a fresh Parameters.Count beside the retained wrapper. Asks when the collection is rebuilt, kept or emptied and what Execute does with a stale collection.",
